## 🔥 Design Philosophy

### "Energy is the New Standard of Integrity"
- Energy consumption is observable, measurable, non-negotiable
- Power efficiency is not optional—it's the basis for correctness
- All decisions validated through quantitative metrics
- No hand-waving, only numbers

### Reuse > Reinvention
- Built on Phase 6-9 research (Bayesian learning, predictive models, ML optimization)
- Adapted 13 components from 5 prior phases
- Proven algorithms, new application domain

### Unforgiving Rules
- 8 rules, each with precise numeric thresholds
- Auto-validation via `GreenFabricMetrics`
- 30 tests ensuring no rule can be violated

